Did you try putting two of the numbers in the top box?  And then give
it the robot?

Did you try to put the result in the next box together with one of
the remaining numbers?

Did you use the third box to multiply the remaining numbers?

There are lots of ways to do this one.  I would put the 365 and the 24
in the first box and give it the robot.  Then I would put the two 60s
in the second box and give it the robot.  Then I would take out the
results from the last hole of the boxes and put them in the third box
and give it to the robot.


